# AI Contribution Log

## 1. Purpose of AI Assistance

ChatGPT was used as an assistance and learning tool during the development of this project.

The AI assistance was mainly used for understanding concepts, discussing implementation approaches, debugging, designing experiments, interpreting results, and organizing the project documentation.

The student was responsible for implementing, running, testing, profiling, verifying, and documenting the final project.

---

