The selected cases produced the following measurements:

| Case | Algorithm | Path Length | Nodes Expanded | Average Time |
|------|-----------|-------------|----------------|--------------|
| Best | BFS | 1 | 3 | 0.0051 ms |
| Best | A* | 1 | 2 | 0.0066 ms |
| Average | BFS | 13 | 53 | 0.0799 ms |
| Average | A* | 13 | 32 | 0.0935 ms |
| Worst | BFS | 21 | 69 | 0.1044 ms |
| Worst | A* | 21 | 68 | 0.2009 ms |

These values were obtained from actual program execution and were not generated by ChatGPT.

